// Off-axis projection from intrinsics (Metal NDC z in [0,1], y up):
// P = [ 2fx/W, 0, 1 - 2ox/W, 0 ;  0, 2fy/H, 2oy/H - 1, 0 ;  0, 0, -far/(far-near), -far*near/(far-near) ;  0, 0, -1, 0 ]  (column-major in simd: columns are the columns of this matrix)
// clip = P * cam, cam = camera.transform.inverse * world. This maps camera -Z forward to NDC, image top to NDC y=+1, so the rendered depth texture row 0 corresponds to capturedImage row 0.
